Assembly %program
Type     app

BuildDirectory         bin/examples
IntermediateDirectory  int/examples
SourceDirectory        examples

SourceFiles            %(program).c

Compiler.Includes      .
Compiler.Defines       TEST

Libraries              zS
Library.Paths          bin

Assert.Arg              program
Assert.WorkingDirectory ..

program.errormessage
{
    The argument value of "program" is equal to any of the .c files (excluding extension) 
    inside of the examples/ directory.
    
    For example: riftbuild example.build program=enough
                 riftbuild example.build program=enough run
}
